", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">eau<br>vin<br>bi\u00e8re<br>cocktails<br>caf\u00e9</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "essayer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "exp\u00e9rimenter par la premi\u00e8re fois un plat, produit ou objet", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je veux essayer plein de plats.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le08ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Ces mots sont utilis\u00e9s quand vous regardez un menu.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "go\u00fbter", "type": "name"}, {"content": "appr\u00e9cier un aliment, une boisson par le go\u00fbt", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je veux go\u00fbter tous les desserts.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le08ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "l'entr\u00e9e", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un plat qui commence avant le repas principal", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Commandons une entr\u00e9e avant le plat principal !", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le08ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le plat principal", "type": "name"}, {"content": "plat servi apr\u00e8s l'entr\u00e9e", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Attention, le plat principal arrive. Ne mange pas trop&nbsp;!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le08ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le cocktail", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un m\u00e9lange de boissons; il est souvent servi avant le repas", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Comment appelles-tu ce cocktail ? Ah tiens ! Margarita.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le08ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "\u00c0 ne pas manquer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "quelque chose que vous devez absolument essayer", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : La margarita est un cocktail \u00e0 ne pas manquer !  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le08ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "Ultra bon", "type": "name"}, {"content": "super bon", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Le poulet au curry est ultra bon.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le08ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Allez sur Internet. Visitez trois sites de trois restaurants que vous connaissez.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choisissez quatre plats de chacun de ces restaurants.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez les informations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Partagez vos informations avec la classe.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "J'identifie les diff\u00e9rentes sections du menu.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je comprends un menu et \u00e9cris des informations sur des plats.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je parle de nourriture.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'utilise les mots cl\u00e9s dans des situations r\u00e9elles.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " <span class=\"italic\">Vouloir </span> au conditionel pr\u00e9sent", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Vous utilisez  <span class=\"italic\">vouloir </span> au conditionnel pr\u00e9sent pour exprimer une possibilit\u00e9, ou un souhait.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " Je voudrais manger du poisson